cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, the Lutar Invariant family, or the Ouroboros Thesis v14, please cite as below."
title: "SZL Holdings Platform — Λ-Invariant Stack (Ouroboros Thesis v14 implementation)"
abstract: >-
  Production TypeScript monorepo implementing the v14 Master Thesis "Λ-Invariant
  Stack + Anatomy-Evolved-v1". Ships the 9-axis Lutar Invariant Λ₉ gate, ρ-closure
  receipts with SHA-256 hash chain + BLAKE3 Merkle nodes, the Egyptian-inspectable
  weight algebra, the ouroboros-invariant package (Λ₆–Λ₉ extended forms with G/I/M/B/N
  axes for kernel compatibility), the ouroboros-guardrails rail layer, the alloy-runtime
  HTTP gate, and a multi-tenant Drizzle schema. Receipt envelope schema is
  zod-validated in ouroboros/runtime/types/src/receipt.ts; benchmark constants
  (K01 build 11.5 µs p50, K04 gate 3.12 µs p50, K06 ρ = 100% on 8000/8000) are
  recorded in v11 (10.5281/zenodo.20119582).
