  abstract: >-
    v14 of the Ouroboros thesis chain consolidates the v1–v13 Λ-invariant
    development into a single 9-axis production gate (Λ₉) with formal Lean 4
    proofs for the closed-form axes (cleanliness, ρ-closure composability,
    deterministic replay) and statistical bounds for the learned axes. The
    receipt envelope schema is the normative AxesSchema in
    ouroboros/runtime/types/src/receipt.ts.
